<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی سکینہ (ص)/زنداں میں مقید ہوئے جسدم حرمِ شاہ</div>

<p>zindaa'n me muqayyad huwe jis dam haram-e shaah<br />
amboh-e qalaaeq huwa darwaaze pa naagaah<br />
balwa huwa is darja ke masdood huwi raah<br />
sar sharm se zanjeer pa aabid ne rakha aah</p>

<p>tha wo araq-e sharm assero'n ke na tan me<br />
rota tha har ek arz o gham-e shah-e zaman me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mash'ghool jo the khel me atfaal wo saare<br />
karti thi sakina wahaa'n hasrat se nazaare<br />
kehti thi ke kya hogaye hamjoli hamaare<br />
baba ali asghar ko kahaa'n leke sidhaare</p>

<p>sab bachhe yahaa khelte hai khanda zanaa'n hai<br />
mai khelti thi jinse wo atfaal kahaa'n hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nagaah namudaar huwi shaam-e gharibaa'n<br />
aaya ghazab aaloodah wahaa'n shimr-e bad eemaa'n<br />
ek ek se muqaatib huwa wo dushman-e yazdaa'n<br />
ab jaao ke hota hai muqafil dar-e zindaa'n</p>

<p>hoyegi rehaayi na kabhi aal-e abaa ki<br />
kal dekhiyo phir sair aseeraan-e balaa ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sunke parishaa'n huwa anboh wo saara<br />
gum hogaya ek shaqs ka farzand qazaara<br />
chillaya pidar uska raha dil pa na yaara<br />
farzand bhi baba use keh keh ke pukaara</p>

<p>wo tifl lipatne jo laga aake pidar se<br />
paida huwi ek aah sakina ke jigar se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bhar bhar ke dam-e sard ye ki bano se guftaar<br />
is bachhe ko dekho ke kya qush hai ye dildaar<br />
kya naam-e pidar pyaar se leta hai har baar<br />
ek ham hai ke hai baap ki furqat me giraftaar</p>

<p>dil me jo mere dard hai qaaleq pa ayaa'n hai<br />
mai kisko kahu'n baap mera baap kahaa'n hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baba mere hote to unhe kehti mai baba<br />
ab baap kahaa'n jisko kahoo'n baap mai dukhya<br />
yu koi pidar beti se ghaafil nahi hota<br />
hairaan hoo'n baba ke wo ashfaaq huwe kya</p>

<p>aada ne hame qaid kiya shaam me laakar<br />
baba mere kyu'n mujh ko nahi dhondhte aakar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke sakina pa jo riqqat huwi taari<br />
bas haaye pidar kehke kayi baar pukaari<br />
tadpi jo zamee'n par to zamee'n hilgayi saari<br />
jhunjlaake kaha shimr ne phir karti ho zaari</p>

<p>ab khoob rulaaunga tujhe mai na daroonga<br />
reh tujh ko aseero'n se judaa qaid karoonga<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phir shimr ne baazu e sakina ko jo pakdaa<br />
kunbe ki taraf usne ajab yaas se dekha<br />
sab qaidyo'n me ek qayaamat huwi barpaa<br />
sajjad ke qadmo'n pa machal kar giri dukhiya</p>

<p>yu lipti thi bhaai se wo is qouf-o qatar me<br />
ek haath to gardan me tha ek haath kamar me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>muh dekh ke sajjad ka kehti thi wo dar kar<br />
ab aap mere rone ke zaamin ho baradar<br />
gar tum se chuti zeest meri hoyegi kyu'n kar<br />
ab rou'n to jo chaahe kare shimr-e sitamgar</p>

<p>bhaiyya mujhe tu shimr se is waqt bachaale<br />
ab rou'n to kar dijiyo zaalim ke hawaale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ab roi so mai roi na phir roungi zinhaar<br />
ab rou'n agar baap ko apne to gunehgaar<br />
farmaao ke ab chod de mujh ko ye jafaakaar<br />
baazu mera dukhne laga aye aabid-e beemaar</p>

<p>kis tarha juda kunbe se hoyegi sakina<br />
tum kehdo qasam khaake na royegi sakina<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehti thi khaincha jo sitamgar ne qazaara<br />
kurta to phata tha wo phata aur bhi saara<br />
tab aabid-e beemar ne rokar ye pukaara<br />
aye shimr ye bin baap ki bachhi hai qudaara</p>

<p>ghaafil teri dehshat se na hoyegi sakina<br />
ab aisi dari hai ke na royegi sakina<br />
____________________________</p>